  <p class="line">&quot;Breathing.&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">Marie looked at Hadrian.</p>
  <p class="line">Hadrian pretended not to notice.</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;From inside the mountain?&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;That's what they claimed.&quot;</p>
