  <p class="line">&quot;Anything else?&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;One claimed the stone was... cold.&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">Hadrian frowned.</p>
  <p class="line">They were standing in snow.</p>
  <p class="line">Gareth apparently shared this observation.</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;It's winter.&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;Colder than winter.&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">Nobody spoke for a moment.</p>
  <p class="line">Gareth walked toward the collapse.</p>
  <p class="line">He inspected the stone carefully.</p>
  <p class="line">Hadrian followed.</p>
  <p class="line">The frost amulet beneath his coat suddenly touched his skin.</p>
  <p class="line">Cold.</p>
  <p class="line">Hadrian flinched.</p>
  <p class="line">He reached beneath his collar.</p>
  <p class="line">The stone was freezing.</p>
  <p class="line">Not cool.</p>
  <p class="line">Freezing.</p>
  <p class="line">He looked toward the cave.</p>
  <p class="line">For the strangest instant, Hadrian felt something impossible.</p>
  <p class="line">Not heard.</p>
  <p class="line">Not saw.</p>
  <p class="line">Felt.</p>
  <p class="line">Something beneath them.</p>
  <p class="line">Sleeping.</p>
  <p class="line">He blinked.</p>
  <p class="line">The sensation disappeared.</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;Hadrian?&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">He looked up.</p>
  <p class="line">Gareth was watching him.</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;Nothing.&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">His uncle studied him for another moment.</p>
  <p class="line">Then returned to the cave.</p>
  <p class="line">They spent nearly an hour searching the collapse.</p>
  <p class="line">No openings.</p>
  <p class="line">No tracks.</p>
  <p class="line">No sign that anything had entered or escaped.</p>
  <p class="line">Eventually Gareth stepped backward.</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;The entrance is sealed.&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">The royal captain nodded.</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;Then the King's concern?&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">&quot;Resolved.&quot;</p>
  <p class="line">Hadrian looked toward the mountain.</p>
  <p class="line">Something about those words bothered him.</p>
  <p class="line">Resolved.</p>
  <p class="line">As though sealing a door proved there was nothing behind it.</p>
